      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo wandu wa Israeli, sikirienyi ijo ilagho BWANA waghora aighu yenyu; aighu ya mbari yose oreijosereghe kufuma isanga ja Misri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni inyo mmbeni neremmanyireghe aghadi ya mbari rose ra ndoenyi; kwa wundu ugho, nichamkaba kwa wundu ghwa makosa ghenyu ghose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kazi ya Mlodi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mashaka gha Samaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangazirenyi wandu wikaiagha ngome ra Ashdodi na ngome ra isanga ja Misri muwizere, “Kwanyikenyi aighu ya mighondi ya Samaria; mzighane iyo ndoghoi iko aho, na makorongo ghawuyabonyeka aghadi yaro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Awandu ndewiichi kubonya hachi, waawuyachura ngome rawo na vilambo visokelo wandu na wutoi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo BWANA waghamba huwu, “M'maiza uchajimara isanga jako, na kuchikanya mawurigha ghako, na kuwusa vilambo viko andenyi ya ngome rako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba huwu, “Sa iji koni mlisha upatagha maghu awi angu kudu kwa ng'ondi kufuma momunyi kwa shimba, huwo koni wandu watinieri tu wa Israeli wikaiagha Samaria, awo wiseagha kidombo aighu ya makochi ghawo wichavuvulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana sikirenyi mpate kuwighoria wandu wa kivalwa cha Jakobo,” waghamba Bwana MLUNGU, uo Mlungu Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ituku niwikabagha wandu wa Israeli kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a rawo, nicharitotesha madhabahu ra Betheli. Nicharichikanya mbembe rose ra madhabahu hata andoenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Waz. 23.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nicharichikanya nyumba ra sumesu na ra kwari. Na iro nyumba ripambilo na mbembe ra chovu nicharitotesha na iro nyumba mbaa richanonwa putu,” waghamba BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
